# <type>(<scope>): <subject>   ← ≤50 chars, imperative mood, no trailing period
#
# Body (wrap at 72): what changed and why, not how. Leave a blank line above.
#
# Footer: "Closes #12", "BREAKING CHANGE: ...", or co-author trailers.
#
# type:  feat | fix | docs | style | refactor | perf | test | build | ci | chore
# scope: a module/area of the codebase (optional)
#
# Enable once with:  git config commit.template .gitmessage
